            "content": "<p><strong>HEART OPENING</strong><br/>'Over 35 years, I learned 112 kriya techniques, but my heart never opened until I learned Atma Kriya Yoga...Atma Kriya Yoga is the only one that awakens love. It went right to my soul and helped me realise I could love everybody. I'd never received Shaktipat (decent of guru's grace) before...It was like my old computer had been given new software, and I was learning to live in a new paradigm.'</p>",
