            "content": "<p><strong>FOUNTAIN OF ETERNAL LOVE</strong><br/>'The practice opened up a deep fountain of eternal love and a profound peace that I’d been looking for. Through it, I came to realise that Atma Kriya Yoga is Bhagavan, God Himself. Over time, I came to experience that each breath is not my own, it is Him who is breathing. It is Him who is seeing. It is Him who is perceiving.'</p>",
